#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:2
msgid "Account authentication methods"
msgstr "账户认证方式"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:4
msgid ""
"Read the Docs supports several authentication methods for creating an "
"account and logging in. The method you choose depends on your preferences "
"and the security requirements of your organization."
msgstr "Read the Docs 支持多种用于创建账户和登录的认证方式。选择哪种方式取决于你的偏好以及组织的安全要求。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:7
msgid ""
"These authentication methods are not mutually exclusive; you can use "
"multiple methods to access your account."
msgstr "这些认证方式并不互斥；你可以同时使用多种方式访问你的账户。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:11
msgid "Email and password"
msgstr "邮箱与密码"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:13
msgid ""
"You can create an account on Read the Docs using your email address and a "
"password. This method works well for individual users and small teams, but "
"it limits the functionality available to you."
msgstr "你可以使用邮箱地址和密码在 Read the Docs 上创建账户。这种方式适合个人用户和小型团队，但会限制你可用的功能。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:18
msgid "VCS provider authentication"
msgstr "VCS 服务商认证"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:20
msgid ""
"You can also create an account on Read the Docs using a VCS authentication "
"provider: GitHub, GitLab, or Bitbucket. This method is more secure and "
"convenient than using an email and password, and provides access to "
"additional features like automatic repository syncing."
msgstr ""
"你也可以使用 VCS 认证服务商在 Read the Docs 上创建账户：GitHub、GitLab 或 "
"Bitbucket。这种方式比邮箱和密码更安全、更便捷，并提供自动仓库同步等额外功能。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:24
msgid "VCS provider authentication is required for the following features:"
msgstr "以下功能需要使用 VCS 服务商认证："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:26
msgid ":doc:`/pull-requests`"
msgstr ":doc:`/pull-requests`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:27
msgid "Automatic repository syncing for easy project creation"
msgstr "自动同步仓库，简化项目创建"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:28
msgid "Automatic webhook creation on project creation"
msgstr "创建项目时自动创建 Webhook"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:32
msgid ":doc:`/guides/connecting-git-account`"
msgstr ":doc:`/guides/connecting-git-account`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:33
msgid "Learn how to connect your Read the Docs account with a Git provider."
msgstr "了解如何将 Read the Docs 账户与 Git 服务商关联。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:36
msgid "Google authentication"
msgstr "Google 认证"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/shared/admonition-rtd-business.rst:2
msgid ""
"This feature is only available on `Read the Docs Business "
"<https://app.readthedocs.com/>`_."
msgstr "此功能仅在 `Read the Docs Business <https://app.readthedocs.com/>`_ 上提供。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:40
msgid ""
"Read the Docs supports Google authentication for organizations. Google "
"authentication works well for users already using Google services, and "
"easily integrates into your existing workflow."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 支持组织使用 Google 认证。对于已在使用 Google 服务的用户，Google "
"认证体验良好，并能轻松融入你现有的工作流程。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:44
msgid ""
"Google provides authentication, but not authorization. This means that you "
"can log in to Read the Docs with this method, but we aren't able to "
"determine which projects you have access to automatically."
msgstr "Google 只提供认证，不提供授权。这意味着你可以用这种方式登录 Read the Docs，但我们无法自动判断你有权访问哪些项目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:50
msgid ":ref:`sso_google_workspace`"
msgstr ":ref:`sso_google_workspace`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:51
msgid "Learn how to configure Google authentication for your organization."
msgstr "了解如何为你的组织配置 Google 认证。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:54
msgid "SAML authentication"
msgstr "SAML 认证"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:58
msgid ""
"Read the Docs supports SAML authentication for organizations. SAML "
"authentication is a secure way to authenticate users and manage access to "
"your organization's projects. This is only available on Enterprise plans, "
"and requires custom integration to be enabled."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 支持组织使用 SAML 认证。SAML "
"认证是一种安全的用户认证和项目访问管理方式。此功能仅在企业版套餐中提供，且需要启用自定义集成。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:63
msgid ""
"SAML provides authentication, but not authorization. This means that users "
"can log in to Read the Docs with this method, but we aren't able to "
"determine which projects each user has access to automatically."
msgstr "SAML 只提供认证，不提供授权。这意味着用户可以用这种方式登录 Read the Docs，但我们无法自动判断每个用户有权访问哪些项目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:69
msgid ":ref:`sso_saml`"
msgstr ":ref:`sso_saml`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:70
msgid "Learn how to configure SAML authentication for your organization."
msgstr "了解如何为你的组织配置 SAML 认证。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:73
msgid "Two-factor authentication"
msgstr "双因素认证"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:75
msgid ""
"Read the Docs supports two-factor authentication (2FA) for added security on"
" all authentication methods. If you have 2FA enabled on your account, you "
"will be prompted to enter a code when logging in."
msgstr "Read the Docs 支持双因素认证（2FA），为所有认证方式增加安全性。如果你的账户启用了 2FA，登录时系统会提示你输入验证码。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:81
msgid ":doc:`/guides/management/2fa`"
msgstr ":doc:`/guides/management/2fa`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/accounts.rst:82
msgid "Learn how to enable and disable two-factor authentication on your account."
msgstr "了解如何在你的账户上启用和禁用双因素认证。"

